  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "つばさの　ほねは　かぜを　うけるとでんきを　つくる。　うみに　とびこみえものを　かんでんさせて　とらえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날개의 뼈는 바람을 받으면 전기를 만들어 낸다. 바다에 뛰어들어 먹이를 감전시켜서 잡는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "當翅膀的骨頭受到風吹時，就能製造出電力。會衝進海裡讓獵物觸電後將其捕獲。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les os de ses ailes produisent de l’électricité grâce au vent. Pour chasser, ce Pokémon plonge dans la mer et électrocute ses proies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trifft Wind auf seine Flügel, erzeugen deren Knochen Strom. Es fängt Beute, indem es ins Meer taucht und ihr einen Stromschlag verpasst.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los huesos de sus alas producen electricidad con las corrientes de aire. Para cazar, se zambulle en el mar y electrocuta a su presa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le ossa delle sue ali generano energia elettrica sfruttando il vento. Si tuffa in mare e folgora le prede per poi catturarle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When its wings catch the wind, the bones within produce electricity. This Pokémon dives into the ocean, catching prey by electrocuting them.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "翼の　骨は　風を　受けると電気を　作る。　海に　飛び込み獲物を　感電させて　捕らえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "当翅膀的骨头受到风吹时，就能制造电力。会冲进海里让猎物触电后将其捕获。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los huesos de sus alas producen electricidad con las corrientes de aire. Para cazar, se zambulle en el mar y electrocuta a su presa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かいがんの　がけに　すを　つくる。すは　パチパチ　はじけるふしぎな　しょっかんで　にんきの　ちんみ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "바닷가 절벽에 둥지를 짓는다. 둥지는 바삭바삭한 식감 덕에 인기 있는 별미다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會在海岸的懸崖上築巢。吃起來劈哩啪啦跳的神奇口感，讓牠的巢成了受歡迎的珍奇美食。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il niche sur les falaises côtières. Son nid possède une texture particulière et un goût naturellement pétillant, ce qui en fait un mets très recherché.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es nistet an Steilküsten. Seine Nester sind als Delikatesse geschätzt, da ihre Textur ein seltsames Knistergefühl im Mund erzeugt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Anida en acantilados costeros. Su nido se considera un auténtico manjar debido a su extraña textura chisporroteante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nidifica sui dirupi a picco sul mare. Il suo nido è una prelibatezza molto amata per l’insolita consistenza scoppiettante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "These Pokémon make their nests on coastal cliffs. The nests have a strange, crackling texture, and they’re a popular delicacy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "海岸の　崖に　巣を　作る。巣は　パチパチ　弾ける不思議な　食感で　人気の　珍味。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在海岸的悬崖上筑巢。它的巢具有在嘴里蹦跳的神奇口感，因此是受欢迎的珍味佳肴。",
      "language": {
